flowchart TD
    Start([New events received]) --> CheckExisting{Existing sessions?}
    CheckExisting -->|No| AssignNew[Assign new session IDs]
    CheckExisting -->|Yes| GetExistingBounds[Get time bounds of existing sessions]
    GetExistingBounds --> GetNewBounds[Get time bounds of new sessions]
    GetNewBounds --> Compare{Compare sessions}
    
    Compare -->|New session extends existing| UseExistingID[Use existing session ID]
    Compare -->|New session precedes existing| UpdateExistingID[Update existing with new session ID]
    Compare -->|No overlap| KeepNew[Keep new session ID]
    
    UseExistingID --> MergeResults[Merge results]
    UpdateExistingID --> MergeResults
    KeepNew --> MergeResults
    
    MergeResults --> WriteNew[Write new data]
    MergeResults --> UpdateExisting[Update existing data if needed]
    
    AssignNew --> WriteData[Write to Delta Lake]
    WriteNew --> WriteData
    UpdateExisting --> Finish([Finish])
    WriteData --> Finish